      "additionalProperties": false,
      "type": "object",
      "title": "=============================================================================\n SCHEMA.ORG MAPPING DEFINITIONS\n =============================================================================\n This file defines the STRUCTURE for Schema.org mappings in the ecosystem.\n The actual mapping values are stored in schema-mappings.yml.\n\n How it works:\n 1. Proto files define message structures (this file)\n 2. schema-mappings.yml contains the actual enum-to-Schema.org mappings\n 3. Config files use enums (e.g., CONTENT_TYPE_TUTORIAL)\n 4. Build system reads schema-mappings.yml and applies mappings automatically\n 5. Generates proper Schema.org JSON-LD structured data\n\n Benefits:\n - Type-safe enum usage in configs\n - Automatic Schema.org mapping (no manual configuration needed)\n - Single source of truth (schema-mappings.yml)\n - Safe by default - configs can only use valid enums\n\n See: schema-mappings.yml for the complete mapping dictionary\n =============================================================================",
      "description": "============================================================================= SCHEMA.ORG MAPPING DEFINITIONS ============================================================================= This file defines the STRUCTURE for Schema.org mappings in the ecosystem. The actual mapping values are stored in schema-mappings.yml. How it works: 1. Proto files define message structures (this file) 2. schema-mappings.yml contains the actual enum-to-Schema.org mappings 3. Config files use enums (e.g., CONTENT_TYPE_TUTORIAL) 4. Build system reads schema-mappings.yml and applies mappings automatically 5. Generates proper Schema.org JSON-LD structured data Benefits: - Type-safe enum usage in configs - Automatic Schema.org mapping (no manual configuration needed) - Single source of truth (schema-mappings.yml) - Safe by default - configs can only use valid enums See: schema-mappings.yml for the complete mapping dictionary =============================================================================  Complete Schema.org mapping configuration for the ecosystem"
    },
